{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/0644af082317c0037cac87a952369e70.poster.avif?t=1761016654\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/0644af082317c0037cac87a952369e70.webm?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/0644af082317c0037cac87a952369e70.mp4?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventurer from an alien planet accidentally lands on the continent of Volant, and so begins the Philna Fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world through battles and puzzle solving, choose the right equipment and skills to build your character, and finally face the shadows invading the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/6c4bd217ba3333d5a8b6b62df1456f9d.poster.avif?t=1761016654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/6c4bd217ba3333d5a8b6b62df1456f9d.webm?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/6c4bd217ba3333d5a8b6b62df1456f9d.mp4?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore every part of Volant, fight monsters in different dungeons, and acquire equipment of higher quality and richer effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/506b9349af4512d1daf93104cfdb2e4f.poster.avif?t=1761016654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/506b9349af4512d1daf93104cfdb2e4f.webm?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/506b9349af4512d1daf93104cfdb2e4f.mp4?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Solve the puzzles hidden in Volant, open the doors that no one has ever passed through, and get the treasure that's been waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/33c33fe787c37ae418074f3940e9f4a0.poster.avif?t=1761016654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/33c33fe787c37ae418074f3940e9f4a0.webm?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/33c33fe787c37ae418074f3940e9f4a0.mp4?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use the materials collected on your journey to forge weapons, craft equipment, refine medicines, and create gems. All materials can be turned into treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/e5e48963a2c151c10c564c54ed0ab229.poster.avif?t=1761016654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/e5e48963a2c151c10c564c54ed0ab229.webm?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/e5e48963a2c151c10c564c54ed0ab229.mp4?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Adventurers are trusted by the residents of Volant. Solve their problems and get paid handsomely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collections: Magic Cards, Treasure Chests, Antiques...... In the continent of Volant, you can always get unexpected rewards to make your adventure life richer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet: Every adventurer should have a little pet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/b58bc1601d85d0e1ca25d258e034c269.poster.avif?t=1761016654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/b58bc1601d85d0e1ca25d258e034c269.webm?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/b58bc1601d85d0e1ca25d258e034c269.mp4?t=1761016654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2591150?t=1761016654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761016654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761016654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761016654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3344980,"description":""}],"detai